From 86e370ab41bf40122e497884319e558d7d9f59fa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lfdevs <lfdevs@lfdevs.com>
Date: Mon, 20 Jul 2026 15:23:15 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] backend-anland: add Anland 5.13 support for Termux

Add the Anland zero-copy backend and synchronize its transport with protocol 5.13. Handle resized buffers, render fences, extended input, runtime display refresh, clipboard and text input, and output scaling.

Add optional PipeWire audio and camera bridges so Termux builds without PipeWire remain supported, plus transport and reconnect tests.
